BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 611.0 Tm (important distinction in independent parsers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (Extents replace long lists of individual block pointers for many files. An extent tree has) Tj ET
