BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 662.0 Tm (mode. Ordered-data journalling is not a promise to journal every byte of user content; it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm (constrains ordering relative to metadata transactions. A completed commit is meaningful) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628.0 Tm (only when storage flush and barrier guarantees are honoured. Metadata checksum features can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 611.0 Tm (detect damage to many critical structures when enabled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (After an unclean shutdown, the journal may replay committed transactions. e2fsck checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (allocation consistency, inode connectivity, reference counts and other issues not resolved) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548.0 Tm (by journal replay. A missing journal checksum or unexpected feature flag must not be) Tj ET
